0b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪游十首 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"北郭西郊外，联鞍共探春。\n惟应旧猿鸟，犹记两诗人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29952,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪游十首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"二客如龙虎，同登蟹井颠。\n吾今成聱叟，渠久作飞仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29953,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪游十首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"昔与二龙友，同寻九鲤祠。\n百身何可赎，一老偶然遗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29954,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪游十首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"扪萝伏虎岩，把钓斩蛟潭。\n偶有樵夫过，呼来与共谈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29955,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纪游十首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"倦后入蒲龛，欣时出草庵。\n偶圆灵照话，亦于善财参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29956,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"羊城使者庙","author":"刘克庄","text":"山川殊壮丽，井邑亦繁雄。\n独有羊城庙，萧然瓦砾中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29957,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老少","author":"刘克庄","text":"上树千回时已过，绕枝三匝老安归。\n向